## 8. Evidence (kind)

| Test | Result |
| --- | --- |
| restricted, RuntimeDefault, `fuse-overlayfs` direct | `cannot mount: Operation not permitted` |
| restricted, RuntimeDefault, `unshare -Urm` | `unshare` EPERM |
| restricted, Localhost profile, `unshare -Urm` + `fuse-overlayfs` | OK: COW, whiteouts, lower untouched |
| restricted, Localhost profile, `unshare -Urm` + kernel overlay | OK |
| baseline, `SETUID`/`SETGID`/`SETFCAP` + priv-esc, `fuse-overlayfs` direct | same `fusermount3` error |
| privileged, root + `SYS_ADMIN`, kernel overlay direct | fails; needs + `MKNOD`, `DAC_OVERRIDE`, `FOWNER`, `CHOWN` |
| restricted, admission of `SYS_ADMIN` or `allowPrivilegeEscalation: true` | rejected |
| Coder v2.36.5 workspace with wrapper entrypoint, `coder ssh` | overlay visible, `uid=1000(coder)`, writes to upper |
| code-server app via Coder | HTTP 200 on the workspace folder |
| `kubectl exec` into the workspace | works, sees empty dir (expected) |

